From: Robert Marko <robert.marko@sartura.hr>
Date: Thu, 16 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] board: airoha: add Datamate NanoDPU

Datamate NanoDPU currently shares the AN7583 evaluation board setup,
except that GDM1 is disabled and GDM2 uses SGMII without in-band status.
Enable GPT partition table support as well.

NanoDPU boots exclusively from eMMC, so omit the unused SPI flash, MTD
and UBI support.

Signed-off-by: Robert Marko <robert.marko@sartura.hr>
---
 arch/arm/dts/an7583-nanoDPU.dts  | 18 ++++++++
 configs/an7583_nanoDPU_defconfig | 72 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 defenvs/an7583_nanoDPU_env       | 14 ++++++
 3 files changed, 104 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm/dts/an7583-nanoDPU.dts
 create mode 100644 configs/an7583_nanoDPU_defconfig
 create mode 100644 defenvs/an7583_nanoDPU_env

--- /dev/null
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/an7583-nanoDPU.dts
@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0-only OR BSD-2-Clause)
+
+#include "an7583-evb.dts"
+
+/ {
+	model = "Datamate NanoDPU";
+	compatible = "datamate,nanoDPU", "airoha,an7583", "airoha,en7583";
+};
+
+&gdm1 {
+	status = "disabled";
+};
+
+&gdm2 {
+	phy-mode = "sgmii";
+	/delete-property/ managed;
+};
+
--- /dev/null
+++ b/configs/an7583_nanoDPU_defconfig
@@ -0,0 +1,72 @@
+CONFIG_ARM=y
+CONFIG_POSITION_INDEPENDENT=y
+CONFIG_ARCH_AIROHA=y
